ations.<\/h3><p>The solution offers a range of features designed to help businesses comply with customs requirements and minimize the risk of delays or fines. For example, businesses can use SAP Transportation Management to manage documentation, track customs clearance processes, and ensure that shipments comply with local regulations.\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-c2fa864 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"c2fa864\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-eff99ea\" data-id=\"eff99ea\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0f869e4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0f869e4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>SAP Transportation Management is also designed to be highly flexible and customizable, enabling businesses in Canada to tailor the solution to their specific needs. The solution can be integrated with other SAP solutions, such as SAP S\/4HANA and SAP Extended Warehouse Management, to provide a complete end-to-end logistics solution. This can help businesses to streamline their operations and improve overall efficiency.\u00a0 \u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9404f58 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9404f58\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t